OL,3,GNEWSANato jets fly in for major defence
OL,4,Aexercise
OL,5,
OL,6,FNato aircraft are taking part in what
OL,7,Fis described as the UK's largest
OL,8,Fhomeland defence exercise.
OL,10,FCobra Warrior 26-2 is based at RAF
OL,11,FWaddington, near Lincoln, until 2
OL,12,FOctober and involves aircraft from the
OL,13,FUK, Germany, Italy, Netherlands and the
OL,14,FUS.
OL,16,FAir Chief Marshal Sir Harv Smyth said:
OL,17,F"Cobra Warrior gives us the opportunity
OL,18,Fto practice our response to aggression,
OL,19,Fensuring we are testing our defences
OL,20,Fand ability to operate alongside Nato
OL,21,Fpartners during a real conflict."
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
