OL,4,Aexercise
OL,5,
OL,6,FAccording to the RAF, planes due to
OL,7,Ftake part include RAF Typhoon jets,
OL,8,FF-35 Lightning stealth aircraft, F-15E
OL,9,FStrike Eagle fighters and Chinook
OL,10,Fhelicopters.
